  "description": "On-device LLM inference for Circle. Alibaba MNN P/Invoke layer with Qwen 3 chat generator. 1.3.2 ships the linux-x64 native payload — libmnnbridge.so (43 KB C ABI shim built from CircleAI/native/mnn-bridge against MNN 3.5.0 with gcc 13.3 on Ubuntu 24.04) + libMNN.so (11 MB Alibaba Release variant). Both propagate to consumer build output via the same CopyToOutputDirectory rule introduced in 1.3.1. CMakeLists.txt now prefers Release over Debug libMNN.so when the Linux release ships a Release/Debug split (silent 5-20× perf regression risk if Debug variant slipped through). 1.3.1 fixed the \"Unable to load DLL mnnbridge\" cycle on Windows: runtimes propagation, NativeRuntimePrep flatten+preload+self-check, actionable error.",
